  "interpretation": "In 2024 each central short band has five visible vertical separators, making six intervals including two edge intervals. The 2018 samples also retain five on each band. In 2014, five are optically recovered at image left and four at image right; the dark right endpoint is not interpolated. Larger flanking piers split these central strips from a distinctly higher short course on each shoulder. Farther along the wings, the continuous roof edge carries additional smaller divisions, not counted as central ornaments. The central raised pad and the immediately lower narrow shoulders, broad shoulders, flanking pier tops and lower outer roof are homologous. Modern lettering, the 2014 blue crest attachments and the separate rooftop lantern are excluded."
